er except the requester.\n2. **#179:** an out-of-range configuration_index answers NO_SUCH_DESCRIPTOR with the current index. STREAM_IS_RUNNING keeps its precedence. Update testbench item A3.\n3. Add suite cases for each behaviour, each with a planted mutant. Regenerate the microcode through `gen_ucode.py` and its ROM digest records only through their generators.\n4. Record both decisions, with the clauses in the issues, in the compliance review. Report, without changing it, what READ_DESCRIPTOR answers for a missing CONFIGURATION index.\n5. Run every processor gate at base and head, plus the parent consumer gates on a scratch parent at dev.\n6. STOP on any register-map, port or parameter change.\n\nPost REVIEW READY or STOP on #178.\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/comments/6237572436/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/comments/6237579484","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/178#issuecomment-6237579484","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/178","id":6237579484,"node_id":"IC_kwDOT06kyc8AAAABc8no3A","user":{"login":"Mister-M-alt","id":161579364,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaGBZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161579364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/us